#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:2
msgid "Server Module Plugins"
msgstr "服务器模块插件"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:4
msgid ""
"The multiprocess ``lmcache server`` is composed from transport-neutral "
"server modules. Built-in modules handle lookup, management, transfer, "
"P2P, KV events, and blend. A server module plugin lets an installed "
"Python package add extra modules at startup without modifying LMCache "
"source."
msgstr ""
"多进程 ``lmcache server`` 由与传输无关的服务器模块组成。内置模块处理查找、管理、传输、P2P、KV "
"事件和混合。服务器模块插件允许已安装的 Python 包在启动时添加额外的模块，而无需修改 LMCache 源代码。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:9
msgid ""
"This mechanism is explicit opt-in. Installing a package is not enough to "
"change server behavior; the operator must pass ``--server-module``."
msgstr "此机制是显式选择加入的。仅仅安装一个包不足以改变服务器行为；操作员必须传递 ``--server-module``。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:13
msgid "When to use it"
msgstr "何时使用它"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:15
msgid ""
"Use a server module plugin when implementation should live in another "
"package. Examples include vendor-specific implementations, experimental "
"handlers, or site-local observability/control modules that reuse "
"LMCache's shared ``MPCacheServerContext``."
msgstr ""
"当实现应该位于另一个包中时，请使用服务器模块插件。示例包括特定于供应商的实现、实验性处理程序或重用 LMCache 共享的 "
"``MPCacheServerContext`` 的站点本地可观察性/控制模块。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:20
msgid ""
"For new extension protocols, prefer a transport-specific service when the"
" extension owns a real client protocol. A plugin can register its own "
"generated gRPC service or its own ZMQ service during LMCache server "
"startup, while the same module also provides status, cleanup, and shared "
"``MPCacheServerContext`` access."
msgstr ""
"对于新的扩展协议，当扩展拥有真实的客户端协议时，优先选择特定于传输的服务。插件可以在 LMCache 服务器启动期间注册其生成的 gRPC "
"服务或其自己的 ZMQ 服务，同时同一模块还提供状态、清理和共享的 ``MPCacheServerContext`` 访问。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:26
msgid ""
"For small control-plane calls that do not need a first-class service, "
"plugins may use the stable ``SERVER_MODULE_CALL`` envelope. The core wire"
" contract stays fixed across transports:"
msgstr "对于不需要一流服务的小型控制平面调用，插件可以使用稳定的 ``SERVER_MODULE_CALL`` 信封。核心通信协议在不同传输中保持不变："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:30
msgid "``method`` is a namespaced string such as ``\"my_package.echo\"``."
msgstr "``method`` 是一个命名空间字符串，例如 ``\"my_package.echo\"``。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:31
msgid "``payload`` is plugin-owned request bytes."
msgstr "``payload`` 是插件拥有的请求字节。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:32
msgid ""
"the response contains ``success``, plugin-owned response ``payload`` "
"bytes, and a human-readable ``error`` string."
msgstr "响应包含 ``success``、插件拥有的响应 ``payload`` 字节和可读的 ``error`` 字符串。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:35
msgid ""
"This gives out-of-tree packages a lightweight fallback namespace without "
"appending a new ``RequestType`` enum value or generated gRPC method for "
"every plugin feature. If a feature needs a high-throughput or strongly "
"typed API, register a package-owned gRPC/ZMQ service. If every LMCache "
"client should know about the API, add that request type, payload, "
"response, and gRPC schema to LMCache core instead."
msgstr ""
"这为树外包提供了一个轻量级的回退命名空间，无需为每个插件功能附加新的 ``RequestType`` 枚举值或生成的 gRPC "
"方法。如果某个功能需要高吞吐量或强类型的 API，请注册一个包拥有的 gRPC/ZMQ 服务。如果每个 LMCache 客户端都应该了解该 "
"API，请将该请求类型、有效负载、响应和 gRPC 架构添加到 LMCache 核心中。"

