"LMCache 驱动的传输路径；请参见 :doc:`/mp/sdk`。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:105
msgid "Module contract"
msgstr "模块契约"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:107
msgid ""
"External modules use the same discovery, dependency, construction, and "
"runtime contract as built-ins. LMCache imports ``module_path``, finds its"
" concrete ``DiscoverableModule`` subclasses, merges them into the built-"
"in dependency graph, and calls ``create(build_ctx)``. There is no "
"external-only base class or factory contract: follow the existing "
"``DiscoverableModule`` implementations under "
"``lmcache.v1.multiprocess.modules``. Plugin-specific configuration is "
"available from ``build_ctx.config_for(module_class)``."
msgstr ""
"外部模块使用与内置模块相同的发现、依赖、构造和运行时契约。LMCache 导入 ``module_path``，找到其具体的 "
"``DiscoverableModule`` 子类，将它们合并到内置依赖图中，并调用 "
"``create(build_ctx)``。没有仅限外部的基类或工厂契约：请遵循 "
"``lmcache.v1.multiprocess.modules`` 下现有的 ``DiscoverableModule`` "
"实现。特定于插件的配置可以通过 ``build_ctx.config_for(module_class)`` 获取。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:115
msgid ""
"Dependencies are class references, just as for built-ins. An external "
"module may depend on a built-in class or on another explicitly loaded "
"external class. Every dependency must be included in the "
"discovered/configured class set. At startup, LMCache logs every "
"constructed module and its declared dependencies as "
"``name(dependencies=[...])``. Handlers are registered in construction "
"order, so a dependent module can override its dependency's handler. "
"Modules close in reverse construction order; ``ManagementModule`` stops "
"its reaper before liveness targets release their state."
msgstr ""
"依赖项是类引用，和内置项一样。外部模块可以依赖于内置类或另一个显式加载的外部类。每个依赖项必须包含在发现/配置的类集中。在启动时，LMCache "
"记录每个构建的模块及其声明的依赖项，格式为 "
"``name(dependencies=[...])``。处理程序按构建顺序注册，因此依赖模块可以覆盖其依赖项的处理程序。模块以反向构建顺序关闭；``ManagementModule``"
" 在活跃目标释放其状态之前停止其收割者。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:125
msgid "Replacing a built-in module"
msgstr "替换内置模块"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:127
msgid ""
"A configured external module can replace a built-in module by subclassing"
" it and retaining the same ``module_name``. The built-in class is not "
"constructed, and dependencies declared with that built-in class resolve "
"to the external instance:"
msgstr "配置的外部模块可以通过继承内置模块并保留相同的 ``module_name`` 来替换内置模块。内置类不会被构造，声明的依赖项将解析为外部实例："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:143
msgid ""
"Only explicitly configured external modules can replace built-ins. "
"Startup fails if an external module uses a built-in name without "
"subclassing that built-in class, or if multiple configured modules use "
"the same name."
msgstr "只有显式配置的外部模块才能替换内置模块。如果外部模块在没有子类化内置类的情况下使用内置名称，或者多个配置模块使用相同名称，则启动将失败。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:147
msgid ""
"Plugin modules can also expose extension protocol methods with "
"``@server_module_handler``:"
msgstr "插件模块还可以使用 ``@server_module_handler`` 暴露扩展协议方法："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:173
msgid ""
"If two modules register the same server-module method name, of either "
"kind, startup fails."
msgstr "如果两个模块注册了相同的服务器模块方法名称，无论是哪种类型，启动将失败。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:177
msgid "Transport-specific services"
msgstr "传输特定服务"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:179
msgid ""
"When an extension owns its protocol, expose the registrar matching the "
"configured transport as a method on the module. LMCache calls it before "
"the request server starts."
msgstr "当扩展拥有其协议时，将与配置的传输匹配的注册器作为模块上的一个方法暴露。LMCache 在请求服务器启动之前调用它。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:183
msgid ""
"For gRPC, register generated services against the concrete "
"``grpc.Server``:"
msgstr "对于 gRPC，将生成的服务注册到具体的 ``grpc.Server``："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:199
msgid ""
"With ``--grpc-server-mode native`` the server is still a ``grpc.Server``,"
" but it sits behind the native front on a private Unix socket: "
"``context.peer()`` in its handlers is that socket, not the client."
msgstr "使用 ``--grpc-server-mode native`` 时，服务器仍然是一个 ``grpc.Server``，但它位于私有 Unix 套接字的本地前端后面：在其处理程序中，``context.peer()`` 是该套接字，而不是客户端。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:203
msgid ""
"For ZMQ, register or start a package-owned ZMQ service against the "
"concrete ``MessageQueueServer``:"
msgstr "对于 ZMQ，注册或启动一个包拥有的 ZMQ 服务到具体的 ``MessageQueueServer``："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:218
msgid ""
"If a ZMQ registrar starts a sidecar socket, the module's ``close()`` "
"method must stop that sidecar. Do not use ``register_zmq_services`` to "
"add ``HandlerType.BLOCKING`` handlers to the core ``MessageQueueServer`` "
"unless the registrar also assigns an executor with "
"``add_normal_thread_pool`` or ``add_affinity_thread_pool`` before "
"startup."
msgstr ""
"如果 ZMQ 注册器启动了一个侧车套接字，则模块的 ``close()`` 方法必须停止该侧车。除非注册器在启动之前还使用 "
"``add_normal_thread_pool`` 或 ``add_affinity_thread_pool`` 分配了一个执行器，否则不要使用"
" ``register_zmq_services`` 将 ``HandlerType.BLOCKING`` 处理程序添加到核心的 "
"``MessageQueueServer``。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:225
msgid "Envelope client calls"
msgstr "信封客户端调用"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:227
msgid "Both ZMQ and gRPC clients expose ``server_module_call``:"
msgstr "两个 ZMQ 和 gRPC 客户端都暴露了 ``server_module_call``："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:247
msgid "Client-affinity calls"
msgstr "客户端亲和性调用"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:249
msgid ""
"Mark a handler with ``requires_client_affinity=True`` to run it on the "
"calling client's affinity thread, the thread that also serves that "
"client's store and retrieve requests. Clients call it with "
"``server_module_affinity_call``:"
msgstr "将处理程序标记为 ``requires_client_affinity=True`` 以在调用客户端的亲和线程上运行它，该线程还处理该客户端的存储和检索请求。客户端通过 ``server_module_affinity_call`` 调用它："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:266
msgid ""
"The transport queues the call in order with the client's other affinity "
"requests: it starts after an earlier store or retrieve from the same "
"client and holds back later ones until it returns, so keep it short. A "
"method is served by exactly one of ``server_module_call`` and "
"``server_module_affinity_call``; calling it through the other returns an "
"error that names the right RPC."
msgstr "传输会将调用按顺序排入队列，与客户端的其他亲和请求一起：它在同一客户端的早期存储或检索之后开始，并在返回之前暂时保留后续请求，因此请保持简短。一个方法只能通过 ``server_module_call`` 或 ``server_module_affinity_call`` 中的一个来服务；通过另一个调用会返回一个错误，指明正确的 RPC。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:273
msgid "Example: layer-wise KV retrieval"
msgstr "示例：逐层 KV 检索"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:275
msgid ""
"A layer-wise retrieval plug-in lets the engine start computing early "
"layers while later layers are still being loaded. Once per engine "
"instance, a unary call sets up a pool of device events. Each retrieve is "
"then one affinity call, so its copies run in order with the client's "
"other store and retrieve requests. Progress frames travel on a channel "
"the plug-in owns, such as a ZMQ PUB socket it binds itself:"
msgstr "逐层检索插件允许引擎在后续层仍在加载时开始计算早期层。每个引擎实例一次性调用设置设备事件池。每次检索都是一次亲和性调用，因此它的副本与客户端的其他存储和检索请求按顺序运行。进度帧通过插件拥有的通道传输，例如它绑定的 ZMQ PUB 套接字："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:323
msgid ""
"Core provides plug-in loading, handler registration through "
"``server_module_handler``, routing of both envelope RPCs through "
"``ExtServerModuleRouter``, and running the affinity call on the client's "
"affinity thread on either ``--transport``. The plug-in owns everything "
"layer-specific: the frame format and channel, the event pool, and the "
"worker-side connector that waits on each event."
msgstr "Core 提供插件加载、通过 ``server_module_handler`` 注册处理程序、通过 ``ExtServerModuleRouter`` 路由信封 RPC，以及在 ``--transport`` 上的客户端亲和线程上运行亲和调用。插件拥有所有与层相关的内容：帧格式和通道、事件池，以及在每个事件上等待的工作端连接器。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:330
msgid ""
"Each frame means the copies for that batch are *enqueued*, not finished; "
"the worker learns they have landed only through the pool event. Device "
"IPC event handles only work within one host, so the worker and the server"
" must run on the same node."
msgstr "每个帧意味着该批次的副本被 *排队*，而不是完成；工作线程仅通过池事件得知它们已到达。设备 IPC 事件句柄仅在一个主机内工作，因此工作线程和服务器必须在同一节点上运行。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:337
msgid "Liveness and cleanup"
msgstr "存活性和清理"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:339
msgid ""
"If a plugin owns per-worker state that should be pinged and reaped by "
"``ManagementModule``, implement the ``InstanceLivenessTarget`` method "
"set:"
msgstr ""
"如果插件拥有每个工作进程的状态，并且该状态应该由 ``ManagementModule`` 进行 ping 和清理，请实现 "
"``InstanceLivenessTarget`` 方法集："

